  "text": "The program is a statutory, long-horizon initiative with a focus on completing national 'missing links', including the Trans-Island Highway. It integrates with the National Economic Corridor Development Plan and MTDP IV, emphasizing climate-resilient and sustainable roads. The use of GIS mapping, remote sensing, and digital monitoring enhances planning accuracy and maintenance scheduling.",
